Package: shinyd-agent
Version: 0.1.0~agent1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: shinyd contributors <noreply@github.com>
Depends: systemd (>= 249)
Description: Private read-only diagnostics agent for shinyd
 This development package provides a Unix socket and a supervised agent.
 It does not install the web panel or execute uploaded Shiny applications.
